WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.296 --> 00:00:02.496
IT REPORTS FROM A FROZEN CHICAGO

00:00:02.497 --> 00:00:05.299
TONIGHT WHERE THE COLD IS

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.500
DEFINITELY TAKING HOLD.

00:00:06.501 --> 00:00:08.903
&gt;&gt; WISCONSIN, MICHIGAN, AND

00:00:08.904 --> 00:00:10.371
ILLINOIS ARE UNDER STATES OF

00:00:10.372 --> 00:00:11.872
EMERGENCY, GIVING GOVERNORS THE

00:00:11.873 --> 00:00:12.740
POWER TO ACTIVATE THE

00:00:12.741 --> 00:00:13.774
NATIONAL GUARD IN ADVANCE OF

00:00:13.775 --> 00:00:16.877
POSSIBLY RECORD-SETTING COLD

00:00:16.878 --> 00:00:17.545
DESCENDING ON THE NORTH AND

00:00:17.546 --> 00:00:19.146
CENTRAL UNITED STATES, WITH THE

00:00:19.147 --> 00:00:21.515
CITIES LIKE CHICAGO SET TO BE

00:00:21.516 --> 00:00:22.316
THE EPICENTER OF THIS

00:00:22.317 --> 00:00:23.050
LIFE-THREATENING WEATHER EVENT.

00:00:23.051 --> 00:00:27.288
&gt;&gt; THE TEMPERATURES TODAY,

00:00:27.289 --> 00:00:28.889
TOMORROW, THURSDAY ARE NOT TO BE

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:29.890
TAKEN LIGHTLY.

00:00:29.891 --> 00:00:30.558
THESE ARE ACTUALLY A PUBLIC

00:00:30.559 --> 00:00:33.093
HEALTH RISK.

00:00:33.094 --> 00:00:35.296
&gt;&gt; A PARTICULAR RISK IN THIS

00:00:35.297 --> 00:00:36.463
BRUTAL COLD IS THE HOMELESS

00:00:36.464 --> 00:00:36.864
POPULATION.

00:00:36.865 --> 00:00:39.466
OUT OF TENT CITY JUST SOUTHWEST

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:41.770
OF CHICAGO SLOOP, GOVERNOR SAYS

00:00:42.204 --> 00:00:46.106
HE WILL NOT TAKE ADVANTAGE OF

00:00:46.107 --> 00:00:47.274
THE WARMING BUSES OR WARMING

00:00:47.275 --> 00:00:49.276
CENTERS THE CITY HAS MADE

00:00:49.277 --> 00:00:49.677
AVAILABLE.

00:00:49.678 --> 00:00:50.644
HE WILL STAY IN HIS TENT.

00:00:50.645 --> 00:00:53.047
&gt;&gt; IT IS CROWDED, MOST OF THE

00:00:53.048 --> 00:00:55.082
TIME THEY'VE GOT BUGS.

00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:57.284
&gt;&gt; WINS THAT HOLD POCKETS OF

00:00:57.285 --> 00:00:58.919
ARCTIC AIR HAVE DESTABILIZED,

00:00:58.920 --> 00:00:59.620
ALLOWING THE SUPER COOL AIR TO

00:00:59.621 --> 00:01:02.890
SLIP SOUTH D UNITED STATES.

00:01:02.891 --> 00:01:03.691
THE RESULT?

00:01:03.692 --> 00:01:04.925
TEMPERATURES ARE PREDICTED TO

00:01:04.926 --> 00:01:07.027
DROP INTO THE NEGATIVE 20s,

00:01:07.028 --> 00:01:07.728
WIND ACCOMPANYING THE WEATHER

00:01:07.729 --> 00:01:11.098
HAS THE POTENTIAL TO CREATE

00:01:11.099 --> 00:01:13.667
WINDSHIELDS OF NEGATIVE 50,

00:01:13.668 --> 00:01:14.868
NEGATIVE 60 DEGREES.

00:01:14.869 --> 00:01:16.170
ENOUGH TO ALLOW FROSTBITE TO

00:01:16.171 --> 00:01:18.038
SAID AND IN A MATTER OF MINUTES.

00:01:18.039 --> 00:01:21.442
&gt;&gt; IT PUTS CITIZENS AT RISK FROM

00:01:21.443 --> 00:01:23.110
THE COLD, THEIR HEARTS STOPPING

00:01:23.111 --> 00:01:24.712
BECAUSE THEIR BODY GETS SO COLD,

00:01:24.713 --> 00:01:26.247
THAT KIND OF A PROBLEM.

00:01:26.248 --> 00:01:29.049
&gt;&gt; NATIONWIDE, MORE THAN 1700

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:30.918
FLIGHTS WERE CANCELED, 8,000

00:01:30.919 --> 00:01:31.552
DELAY DUE TO THE WEATHER.

00:01:31.553 --> 00:01:34.722
WHEN TEMPERATURES DROP BELOW 0,

00:01:34.723 --> 00:01:35.556
SALT AND CHEMICALS THAT MELT

00:01:35.557 --> 00:01:37.491
ROAD ICE ARE NO LONGER

00:01:37.492 --> 00:01:38.692
EFFECTIVE, SO EVEN AFTER

00:01:38.693 --> 00:01:39.994
PLOWING, ROADS ARE EXPECTED TO

00:01:39.995 --> 00:01:41.895
BE ICY AND DANGEROUS.

00:01:41.896 --> 00:01:43.464
ROAD CREWS ARE ACTIVATED AS FAR

00:01:43.465 --> 00:01:44.465
SOUTH AS GEORGIA WHERE THE

00:01:44.466 --> 00:01:45.899
WEATHER IS EXPECTED TO REACH

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:46.867
BEARD ALSO WHERE THE SUPER BOWL

00:01:46.868 --> 00:01:46.968
IS BEING

00:01:47.469 --> 00:01:47.968
PLAYED ON SUNDAY.

00:01:47.969 --> 00:01:49.503
&gt;&gt; IT IS OBVIOUSLY VERY

00:01:49.504 --> 00:01:50.170
IMPORTANT BECAUSE A LOT OF

00:01:50.171 --> 00:01:51.505
PEOPLE ARE GOING TO BE IN TOWN

00:01:51.506 --> 00:01:52.106
THIS WEEK.

00:01:52.107 --> 00:01:55.542
WE WANT TO KEEP THEM SAFE.

00:01:55.543 --> 00:01:58.679
&gt;&gt; CHICAGO IS NOW UNDER A

00:01:58.680 --> 00:01:59.413
WINDCHILL ADVISORY THAT WILL

00:01:59.414 --> 00:02:01.348
TRANSFER TO A WARNING AT THE END

00:02:01.349 --> 00:02:02.650
OF THIS BROADCAST, MEANING

00:02:02.651 --> 00:02:05.052
LIFE-THREATENING CONDITIONS ARE

00:02:05.053 --> 00:02:06.087
IMMINENT.

